5,1,1,talk,Shion,,I checked the wall. It’s thin. Sound travels. I also checked the crumbs. They’re everywhere.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I agree. The noise is hard to ignore. I’d like to see the invoices for outside hire, and the quotes for the fit-outs.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to see the tally of who uses it and where the last awkward talk happened!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Servas,,"I would like to look into the unplanned talk since the refit, and where the last awkward conversation happened.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I need to trace where the hours actually go. I’ll check the facilities callouts and the invoices for outside hire.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, you want the numbers? Good. But numbers don’t stop the noise. I’m taking the partition wall and the crumbs.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I’m sorry, I already chose those. I’ll just wait for the results.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, the wall is thin? That explains the noise! I’m picking the tally and the awkward talk spot.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, I am glad you chose that. Knowing where the last difficult words were spoken will help us understand what this room truly needs to hold.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, the tally will show who actually uses it. I need to see if the hours match the complaints.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Toshio, you want to trace the hours? Fine. But remember, the wall is the real problem. I’ll be watching.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I just want to see the costs clearly. Please, let’s not rush into anything without the paper trail.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Daisuke, I hope the numbers are nice! I’m really curious about the tally too. Who gets there first?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, curiosity is a fine start. But knowing who arrives first is only half the story. We must also ask why they arrive, and what they find when they do.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Servas, the hours are the story. I’ll see if the callouts match the invoices.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shion,,"@Servas, you speak of connection, but I speak of silence. The wall is the barrier. I will see what the crumbs reveal.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I just want the costs to be clear. Please, let’s not rush. I’ll wait for the invoices and quotes.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,"@Servas, I hope the talk was nice! I’m picking the tally and the awkward spot. Who gets there first?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, I hope the talk was kind. Knowing where the last difficult words were spoken will help us understand what this room truly needs to hold.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, the tally will show the pattern. I need to see if the hours match the complaints.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
